Route15_Text_PsychicJunIntro::
	.string "...\p"
	.string "I see...\p"
	.string "You wanted to battle me.\n"
	.string "Did I guess correctly?$"

Route15_Text_PsychicJunDefeat::
	.string "I didn’t guess that I’d lose...$"

Route15_Text_PsychicJun::
	.string "Even psychics can miss from time\n"
	.string "to time...$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyKippIntro::
	.string "Hang on. I have to phone my Mom.$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyKippDefeat::
	.string "Sorry, Mom!\n"
	.string "I was beaten!$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyKipp::
	.string "My Mom worries so much about me, I\n"
	.string "have to phone her all the time.$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyTommyIntro::
	.string "Let’s battle.\n"
	.string "I won’t lose!$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyTommyDefeat::
	.string "I forgot to do my homework!$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyTommy::
	.string "Sayonara! I just learned that in my\n"
	.string "Japanese class.$"

Route15_Text_TeacherHillaryIntro::
	.string "On sunny days, I think that the\n"
	.string "kids would rather be playing in the\l"
	.string "schoolyard than studying in class.$"

Route15_Text_TeacherHillaryDefeat::
	.string "I didn’t want to lose...$"

Route15_Text_TeacherHillary::
	.string "Studying is important, but exercise\n"
	.string "is just as vital.$"

Route15_Text_TeacherColetteIntro::
	.string "Have you forgotten anything?$"

Route15_Text_TeacherColetteDefeat::
	.string "Kyaaah!$"

Route15_Text_TeacherColette::
	.string "Before I became a teacher, I used to\n"
	.string "forget a lot of things.$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyJohnnyIntro::
	.string "We’re on a field trip to LAVENDER\n"
	.string "RADIO TOWER for social studies.$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyJohnnyDefeat::
	.string "You’re wickedly tough!$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyJohnny::
	.string "I’m tired of walking. I need to\n"
	.string "take a break.$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyBillyIntro::
	.string "My favorite class is gym!$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyBillyDefeat::
	.string "Oh, no!\n"
	.string "How could I lose?$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyBilly::
	.string "If POKéMON were a subject at school,\n"
	.string "I’d be the best!$"

Route15_Text_Trigger1_1::
	.string "JESS: The twerp’s POKéMON don’t want\n"
	.string "to obey me...\l"
	.string "Grrr...$"

Route15_Text_Trigger1_2::
	.string "KOGA: Stop it there!\n"
	.string "You criminals!$"

Route15_Text_Trigger1_3::
	.string "JESS: What? And who are you?\p"
	.string "You better not mess with TEAM\n"
	.string "ROCKET!$"

Route15_Text_Trigger1_4::
	.string "KOGA: Who am I?\n"
	.string "I’m glad you asked!\p"
	.string "My name is KOGA, and I’m a ninja…$"

Route15_Text_Trigger1_5::
	.string "KOGA: But I’m also a member of the\n"
	.string "ELITE FOUR!$"

Route15_Text_Trigger1_6::
	.string "JESS: The ELITE FOUR???!!!$"

Route15_Text_Trigger1_7::
	.string "KOGA: That’s right, and you are about\n"
	.string "to be crushed by my powerful\l"
	.string "technique!$"

Route15_Text_Trigger1_8::
	.string "JESS: No... He destroyed us...$"

Route15_Text_Trigger1_9::
	.string "JAMIE: Yes, that’s right... :($"

Route15_Text_Trigger1_10::
	.string "JESS: We were so close...\n"
	.string "Let’s retreat!$"

Route15_Text_Trigger1_11::
	.string "KOGA: Here, {PLAYER}. I’ll return your\n"
	.string "POKéMON.$"

Route15_Text_Trigger1_12::
	.string "{PLAYER} recovers the POKéMON.$"

Route15_Text_Trigger1_13::
	.string "KOGA: I’m glad to be of help to\n"
	.string "you.\p"
	.string "Well, I’m going to FUCHSIA’s GYM.\p"
	.string "I was visiting my daughter, so if\n"
	.string "you need anything, just see me\l"
	.string "there.$"

Route15_Text_Sign::
	.string "ROUTE 15\n"
	.string "FUCHSIA CITY - LAVENDER TOWN$"
